### PrepHub Real-Time Workspace REST API Spec
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. User Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Mercer",
  "email": "alex@prephub.dev",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### 2. User Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@prephub.dev",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### 3. Retrieve Workspace Active Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

### 4. Create Workspace Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "roomName": "System Design Prep Room",
  "topic": "Microservices Sync"
}

### 5. Execute Code in Secure Docker Sandbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/sandbox/run
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "language": "javascript",
  "code": "console.log('Hello PrepHub compiler!');"
}

### 6. Query Gemini AI Reviewer for Complexity analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "code": "function findMax(arr) { return Math.max(...arr); }",
  "language": "javascript",
  "taskContext": "Find maximum value in an array"
}
